OL,3,GNEWSALeaders react after 'super
OL,4,Acouncil' paused by No10
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucestershire's leaders have said no
OL,7,Fone "saw this coming" after Number 10
OL,8,Fannounced earlier that a major shake-up
OL,9,Fof local government had been put on
OL,10,Fhold.
OL,12,FIn Gloucestershire, the county's seven
OL,13,Fcouncils were to be merged into one
OL,14,Funitary authority or "super council".
OL,15,FThe county is one of 14 areas where
OL,16,Flocal government reorganisation (LGR)
OL,17,Fis now being paused while a review is
OL,18,Fcarried out.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
