OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSALeaders react after 'super
OL,4,Acouncil' paused by No10
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeader of Gloucestershire County
OL,7,FCouncil Lisa Spivey described herself
OL,8,Fas "reeling" from Monday's
OL,9,Fannouncement.
OL,11,FWhereas others, like Gloucester City
OL,12,FCouncil leader Jeremy Hilton, welcomed
OL,13,Fa review, saying one unitary council
OL,14,Fwas "damaging to the city of
OL,15,FGloucester" and "not ideal" for the
OL,16,Fcounty either.
